{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \nGO:1905353 ciliary transition fiber assembly\nGO:0097711 ciliary basal body-plasma membrane docking\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31882\n\nBoth will be replaced by GO:1905349 ciliary transition zone assembly.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Pt15rM7eVbylHEoy0ir7Ml-54irfFUDYGYQMH7i7tEI\n\nImpacted groups: \n~FlyBase 2~ DONE\n~MGI 1~ DONE\n~Reactome 1~ DONE\n~UniProt 1~ DONE\n~Xenbase 1~ DONE\nZFIN 1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n[LIST IDs + ADD ASSIGNEES] \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-05-04T23:18:16Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0097711 ciliary basal body-plasma membrane docking Biological Process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-26T08:34:36Z"}
